<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Forasol-Foramer cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Forasol-Foramer cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman said analyst Janice Rudd cut the rating of Forasol-Foramer NV to a neutral from its prior rating of buy on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/8 to 18-3/8.</p>
